/*
 * STATIC ARABIC FOR THE GENERAL RA LIBRARY
 * ========================================
 * English -> Arabic dictionary, one entry per line of hazard / effect /
 * control text in js/globalRisks.js. Loaded right after globalRisks.js; on
 * page load it fills every BLANK Arabic field (ar: '') of the library, line
 * by line. No internet needed, and globalRisks.js itself stays unchanged.
 *
 * - Arabic typed directly in globalRisks.js is never overwritten.
 * - Matching ignores case, extra spaces and the final full stop.
 * - A field is filled only if ALL its lines are found; otherwise it stays
 *   blank so "Auto-translate All to Arabic" can fill it. Missing lines are
 *   listed in the browser console (F12) and in window.GLOBAL_RA_AR_MISSING -
 *   add them below to make them static.
 * - Technical / HSE terms that read poorly in Arabic (PPE, PTW, Tool Box
 *   Talk, Performing Authority, PSIC, ATEX, SWL, ESD, MSDS, ...) are kept
 *   in English on purpose.
 *
 * To add a line:  "English line exactly as in globalRisks.js.": "الترجمة",
 */

